1
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:08,801
A small house in Hyderabad. All
the happiness in that home...

2
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:10,890
was their only son, Abhinav.

3
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:17,230
Here, dear... curd and sugar. It's your
first-salary day... go well, and come back.

4
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:21,650
Amma, this Sunday I want to
take you both to Srisailam.

5
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:25,570
It was Tatayya's wish... I'll
fulfil it with my salary!

6
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:33,190
Ride slowly. Your Tatayya's rudraksha
is on your wrist... take care.

7
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:36,730
Okay, Nanna! I'll be back
with sweets this evening!

8
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:41,550
But fate... had something
else written for that day.

9
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:56,060
Oh no! He tried to save that
little girl... and he's down!

10
00:00:56,560 --> 00:01:00,243
Hello, 108? There's been an
accident near the Ameerpet signal!

11
00:01:00,243 --> 00:01:02,560
The boy is unconscious... come quickly!

12
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:07,340
Out of pure humanity, he
saved a little girl's life...

13
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:11,700
but now his own life flickered
like a lamp in the wind.

14
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:18,960
Hello... is this Abhinav's home?
I'm calling from City Hospital.

15
00:01:19,460 --> 00:01:23,220
Yes... I'm his mother. What happened?

16
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:27,741
Amma, I'm sorry... your
son has had an accident.

17
00:01:27,741 --> 00:01:30,840
It's serious. Please come right away.

18
00:01:32,290 --> 00:01:34,690
Listen...! Our Abhi...!

19
00:01:35,190 --> 00:01:40,950
O Lord... nothing must happen to
my child... nothing, Swami...

20
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:48,960
He has a severe head injury, with internal
bleeding. We must operate right away.

21
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:52,980
Doctor... how is my son?

22
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:58,680
We'll do everything we can. Please
sign here... every minute counts.

23
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:02,860
Please save my son somehow, Doctor!

24
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:09,680
Shivayya... take my life if you
must... but save my child, Father...

25
00:02:10,180 --> 00:02:15,780
He hasn't even seen life yet, Swami...
if you must take someone, take me.

26
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,800
I fed him curd and sent
him off this morning...

27
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:21,480
he said he'd come back with
sweets this evening...

28
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:26,680
Doctor! BP is falling...
I can't find a pulse!

29
00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:30,780
Get the defibrillator ready... quickly!

30
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:40,680
In that fear... Raghava
remembered his father's words.

31
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:46,837
Raghava... on the day no medicine works,
the day death stands at the door...

32
00:02:46,837 --> 00:02:52,940
chant the Mahamrityunjaya mantra. Chant it
with faith... and even Yama steps back.

33
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:57,440
(Raghava chants the
Mahamrityunjaya mantra)

34
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:31,640
Abhinav... your time is over. Come.

35
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:35,340
Lord Yama awaits you.

36
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:40,400
No... my mother, my father...
they can't live without me!

37
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:48,180
Stop! This soul's time has not yet come.
His work on earth is not yet done.

38
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,680
As you command, Mahadeva.

39
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:53,580
Go, my child... go back.

40
00:03:58,330 --> 00:04:02,580
His heart had stopped... but
suddenly it started beating again!

41
00:04:02,580 --> 00:04:07,370
In twenty years of practice I've never
seen this. It's truly a miracle!

42
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:10,670
Shivayya... your grace...

43
00:04:11,170 --> 00:04:14,370
You heard our plea, Swami!

44
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:24,560
Abhi... my dear! You opened your eyes,
my child... my life has come back!

45
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:30,100
I heard you saved that little
girl... I'm so proud of you.

46
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:34,440
Amma... Nanna... I went
somewhere far away...

47
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:38,280
but the power of your
mantra brought me back.

48
00:04:40,030 --> 00:04:45,196
Abhinav, your journey does not end here. A
great task you must fulfil still remains.

49
00:04:45,196 --> 00:04:49,993
A great responsibility that will give
your life its true meaning awaits you...

50
00:04:50,493 --> 00:04:55,965
What else did the divine voice
tell Abhinav? Who must he save?

51
00:04:55,965 --> 00:05:01,613
To find out... follow and subscribe
to Mantra Shakti for Part 2!

